[85.248934, "o", "\u001b[32m**Phase: Phase 1**\r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThis folder holds the business framing that every later technical decision is justified against. Write it in Phase 1 an\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[8;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## What belongs here\r\u001b[10d\u001b[35m- \u001b[36m`charter.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — scope, success criteria, assumptions, and what is explicitly out of scope.\r\u001b[11d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[36m`business-profile.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — your persona's sector, data sensitivity, and growth pressures, in one page.\r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[36m`popia-exposure.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — how the Protection of Personal Information Act applies to this persona, and which data matters \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[14;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Evidence rule\r\u001b[16d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEverything in this folder must be readable text: source files, transcripts, reports, or plain-language descriptions. No\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[2;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
