[233.708608, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[233.709461, "o", "\u001b[28d\u001b[K"]
[233.752301, "o", "\u001b[1;72H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m*\u001b[119G\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[233.75246, "o", "\r\u001b[2dReputational damage\r\u001b[3dLoss of customer trust\r\u001b[4dOperational disruption\r\u001b[5dBecause customer information is essential to lending operations, any significant compromise could affect both business \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[6;1H"]
[233.7526, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mSecurity Implications\r\u001b[7dThe organisation requires measures that support:\r\u001b[8dProtection of personal information throughout its lifecycle\r\u001b[9dAppropriate control of access to customer information\r\u001b[10dAccountability for information-processing activities\r\u001b[11dProtection against unauthorised disclosure, alteration, or loss\r\u001b[12dContinued availability of information required for lending operations\r\u001b[13dThese considerations provide a business justification for the security architecture and control-selection activities th\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[14;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mConclusion\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m<\u001b(B\u001b[mr Thusanang Microlending.\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[239.896323, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[239.896542, "o", "\rPOPIA exposure arises primarily from the collection and processing of personal, financial, and credit-related informati\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[14;11H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[240.113914, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
