[4760.709909, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[36m##POPIA Exposure Assessment: Thusanang Microlending\r\u001b[4d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhy POPIA Applies\r\u001b[5dThusanang Microlending processes personal information as part of its lending activities. The digital loan origination p\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[6;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mPOPIA requires organisations processing personal information to take appropriate and reasonable measures to protect tha\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[7;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mPersonal Information Processed\r\u001b[8dThe platform is expected to process multiple categories of personal information, including:\r\u001b[9dNames and contact information\r\u001b[10dSouth African identity numbers\r\u001b[11dResidential address information\r\u001b[12dBank statements\r\u001b[13dIncome and employment information\r\u001b[14dCredit and affordability information\r\u001b[15dLoan applications and lending records\r\u001b[16dThis information is required to support lending decisions and associated business operations.\r\u001b[18d\u001b[36m#Information Requiring the Greatest Protection\r\u001b[20d"]
[4760.710213, "o", "\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThe following information is considered particularly sensitive because misuse, disclosure, or loss could create the gre\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mSouth African identity numbers\r\u001b[22dFinancial information contained in bank statements\r\u001b[23dIncome and employment information\r\u001b[24dCredit-bureau and affordability-assessment information\r\u001b[25dLoan applications and lending records\r\u001b[26dThe combination of personal and financial information increases the potential harm that could result from unauthorised \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[27;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mPotential Harm to Data Subjects\r\u001b[2d\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
