[5085.299088, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Project Charter — \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m<Thusanang Microlending>\r\u001b[4d\u001b[32m_Complete this in Phase 1._\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Team and Phase 1 Roles: Thusanang Microlending\r\u001b[7d"]
[5085.299116, "o", "\u001b[32m**Build Lead:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Hattinie Freyer\u001b[8;3H"]
[5085.299149, "o", "\u001b[32m*Responsibilities:*\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Owns the infrastructure code, container definitions, pipeline configuration, and toolchain verifi\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[9;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**Assurance Lead:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Yanga Tutshana\u001b[10;3H\u001b[32m*Responsibilities:*\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Owns the threat model, scanner findings and remediation, runbooks, and evidence records.\r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Scope\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What this platform will and will not do. This platform will provide infrastucture for expanding into new provices and \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[15;1H"]
[5085.299445, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Success criteria\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_How we will know the platform is good enough. The platform must not only provide a safe place for the data but must al\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[18;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Assumptions\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What we are taking as given. We are asssuming that a lot of data will have to be entered and cataloged. Also assuming \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## Out of scope\r\u001b[22d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What we are deliberately not doing this year. We will not be focusing on already setteled infastructure or how to secu\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[2;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
